  "notes": [
    "All bank and shinkin editions open the same rate popup (popwin key fc_everybodyplus_rate -> /window/fc-everybodyplus/rate/) from the window list, so one rate series per type covers every edition. Which type a distributor sells differs (see each distributor's types).",
    "Metric planned_rate is 予定利率. The rate is set twice a month (1st and 16th) and applies to contracts whose 契約日 (the later of the underwriting-disclosure date and the premium receipt date) falls in that half-month window; effective_date is the first day of the window. It applies until the day before the next 予定利率計算基準日, i.e. 10 years from the contract date (適用する期間 10年); this is stored in term_years. The page itself states that 予定利率 is not the effective yield and that premiums are not compounded at it.",
    "age_band is the contract age (満年齢) of the insured: 18-75 and 76-85 on the current page (20-75 on the 2020 capture). The page notes that markets can make some ages or sexes not offered; no sex dimension is published.",
    "plan unyou = 運用重視タイプ (policy form [Ⅱ型]); plan balance = バランスタイプ.",
    "has_mva is true: 解約・減額 applies 市場価格調整 (market-value adjustment) to the surrender value, which can fall below the basic sum insured. Initial cost 3.80% of the basic sum insured for both types (契約初期費用), plus ongoing 保険契約関係費用 not published; FX: 円入金特約 TTM+25銭, 円支払特約 TTM-25銭.",
    "Rate page shows only the current half-month window and is overwritten; history accumulates by re-running scripts/mys.py. Only two Wayback captures exist (2020-05-27, 2023-11-30). The 2020 capture is the earlier single-type generation (no type headings, 20-75/76-85, USD 1.90%) and is saved in sources/mys/wayback but NOT ingested because it cannot be assigned to unyou or balance without guessing. The 2023-11-30 capture (window 2023-12-01 to 12-15) is ingested.",
    "Product pages are dated 2026年4月版 (digital book dbook26_apr); older 'ターゲット特則なし' editions exist under /window/fc-everybodyplus2-targetless/ and are not covered.",
    "The site answers intermittently (some page fetches time out and succeed on retry); no bot protection was bypassed and the built-in browser was not needed.",
    "Brochures (デジタルブック/PDF) and policy conditions are not downloaded; URLs are listed under documents.",
    "Launch date: 2017-08 (month only), from Meiji Yasuda's release of 2023-03-09: 「２０１７年８月以来長きにわたってご愛顧いただいております「外貨建・エブリバディプラス」」. The 運用重視タイプ ([Ⅱ型], eco シリーズ) was added from 2023-04-03 (same release); the バランスタイプ has been revised since 2017 under the same marketed name. Retrieved 2026-11-17."
  ],
  "notes_en": [
    "Only two rate sets are held: the window from 1 December 2023 and the current one, because the insurer overwrites its page every half-month.",
    "An older 2020 capture is not used, as it cannot be assigned to the growth-focused or balanced type.",
    "The rate shown is the planned rate fixed for 10 years from the contract date, not an effective yield.",
    "All bank editions share one rate page, but which type each distributor sells varies.",
    "On sale since August 2017 (month only, insurer's release); the growth-focused type was added from 3 April 2023. The brochures have not been read, and exchange rates are not collected."
  ],
